# tally 2.2.1 P32, N3 through a scenario's from (P26's path, the review's d1_sc): the decision on a window across
# from is left out on 04-29 and 04-30 and counted from 05-01, so cn, fl and sm are the hole, the pins differing.
# tally 2.2 printed 0 and 0.00 PLN.
=== d1_base.tally
model d1b
  tally 2
  on 2026-06-10
  start 2026-03-01
  end 2026-06-30
source s "s"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
place konto: accounts PLN lives 2026-01-01..
place world: outside lives 1900-01-01..
input amt: money PLN
input w: date
version v
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  amt = 100.00 PLN "s"
  w = window(2026-04-29, 2026-05-02) "s"
  opening[konto] = 500.00 PLN at 2026-03-01 start "s"
ask base: bal(konto, 2026-05-31)
=== d1_sc.tally
scenario sc over d1b
  tally 2
  from 2026-05-01
move dx: transfers
  on w
  reads konto
  leg cash from world to konto amount if bal(konto) > 0 PLN then amt else amt
ask ex: explain bal(konto, 2026-05-31) in sc
ask cn: count(m in transfers over 2026-05) in sc
ask fl: flows(dx, 2026-04 .. 2026-05) in sc
ask a20260430: bal(konto, 2026-04-30) in sc
ask a20260430_p20260429: bal(konto, 2026-04-30) in sc with w = 2026-04-29
ask a20260430_p20260430: bal(konto, 2026-04-30) in sc with w = 2026-04-30
ask a20260430_p20260501: bal(konto, 2026-04-30) in sc with w = 2026-05-01
ask a20260430_p20260502: bal(konto, 2026-04-30) in sc with w = 2026-05-02
ask a20260501: bal(konto, 2026-05-01) in sc
ask a20260501_p20260429: bal(konto, 2026-05-01) in sc with w = 2026-04-29
ask a20260501_p20260430: bal(konto, 2026-05-01) in sc with w = 2026-04-30
ask a20260501_p20260501: bal(konto, 2026-05-01) in sc with w = 2026-05-01
ask a20260501_p20260502: bal(konto, 2026-05-01) in sc with w = 2026-05-02
ask a20260502: bal(konto, 2026-05-02) in sc
ask a20260502_p20260429: bal(konto, 2026-05-02) in sc with w = 2026-04-29
ask a20260502_p20260430: bal(konto, 2026-05-02) in sc with w = 2026-04-30
ask a20260502_p20260501: bal(konto, 2026-05-02) in sc with w = 2026-05-01
ask a20260502_p20260502: bal(konto, 2026-05-02) in sc with w = 2026-05-02
ask a20260503: bal(konto, 2026-05-03) in sc
ask a20260503_p20260429: bal(konto, 2026-05-03) in sc with w = 2026-04-29
ask a20260503_p20260430: bal(konto, 2026-05-03) in sc with w = 2026-04-30
ask a20260503_p20260501: bal(konto, 2026-05-03) in sc with w = 2026-05-01
ask a20260503_p20260502: bal(konto, 2026-05-03) in sc with w = 2026-05-02
ask a20260531: bal(konto, 2026-05-31) in sc
ask a20260531_p20260429: bal(konto, 2026-05-31) in sc with w = 2026-04-29
ask a20260531_p20260430: bal(konto, 2026-05-31) in sc with w = 2026-04-30
ask a20260531_p20260501: bal(konto, 2026-05-31) in sc with w = 2026-05-01
ask a20260531_p20260502: bal(konto, 2026-05-31) in sc with w = 2026-05-02
ask cn_p0430: count(m in transfers over 2026-05) in sc with w = 2026-04-30
ask cn_p0501: count(m in transfers over 2026-05) in sc with w = 2026-05-01
ask fl_p0430: flows(dx, 2026-04 .. 2026-05) in sc with w = 2026-04-30
ask fl_p0501: flows(dx, 2026-04 .. 2026-05) in sc with w = 2026-05-01
ask sm: sum(m.cash.amount for m in transfers over 2026-05) in sc
ask sm_p0501: sum(m.cash.amount for m in transfers over 2026-05) in sc with w = 2026-05-01
=== expect cn fl sm cn_p0430 cn_p0501
cn: ?"date within window(2026-04-29, 2026-05-02) not precise enough for a binding over dx" (w)
  unknown day: w
  world: sc
  unfulfilled: dx
  cut 2026-06-10
fl: ?"date within window(2026-04-29, 2026-05-02) not precise enough for flows of dx" (w)
  unknown day: w
  world: sc
  unfulfilled: dx
  cut 2026-06-10
sm: ?"date within window(2026-04-29, 2026-05-02) not precise enough for a binding over dx" (w)
  unknown day: w
  world: sc
  unfulfilled: dx
  cut 2026-06-10
cn_p0430: 0
  world: sc
  cut 2026-06-10
cn_p0501: 1
  pinned: w = 2026-05-01
  world: sc
  unfulfilled: dx
  cut 2026-06-10
